      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The opposing team, tested by adversity, faced a pivotal setback when a pivotal team was deprived of its core strength. Yet, even after a disruptive change made during a critical period, the interim head coach provided steady guidance. His coaching performance and playoff coaching led to team improvement and team advancement, resulting in a playoff series win and finally, the outcome of the conference final: earning a place in the championship series qualification.",
