    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The Western Conference Final became a proving ground for finalists when the injured stars were sidelined. The franchise acted with a management decision, a mid-season firing that introduced the coach. His winning record and series victory through playoff runs set the stage for the performance in a game, a defensive performance that secured the sweep. This team achievement of reaching the Stanley Cup Final shows that even in sports events, hope and perseverance can guide you home.",
